OL,3,GNEWSABank Holiday rail journeys delayed
OL,4,Aby engineering work
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers face disruption to
OL,7,Ftheir journeys over the bank holiday
OL,8,Fweekend due to engineering work
OL,9,Fimpacting CrossCountry routes.
OL,11,FThe operator is warning of longer
OL,12,Fjourney times and changes to services,
OL,13,Fin particular through Birmingham, with
OL,14,FHS2-related work closing the line
OL,15,Fbetween Birmingham New Street and
OL,16,FColeshill Parkway.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
