OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABank Holiday rail journeys delayed
OL,4,Aby engineering work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new viaduct is to be installed at
OL,7,FWater Orton, Warwickshire, and on
OL,8,FSunday track improvement work will be
OL,9,Fcarried out between Wolverhampton and
OL,10,FStafford, with replacement buses
OL,11,Frunning between Wolverhampton, Stafford
OL,12,Fand Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,14,FEngineering work elsewhere would also
OL,15,Fincrease demand on services as well as
OL,16,Fstrike action by other operators,
OL,17,FCrossCountry said.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
